#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:4
msgid "分类显示"
msgstr "Classification display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:9
msgid "分类显示节点用于在图像上可视化 **分类模型** 的预测结果，支持单标签和多标签分类的展示。"
msgstr ""
"The classification display node is used to visualize the prediction results "
"of the **classification model** on the image, supporting the display of "
"single-label and multi-label classification."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:11
msgid "该节点提供丰富的文本样式配置选项，包括字体大小、颜色、对齐方式、背景色等，可以清晰地展示分类结果及其置信度信息。"
msgstr ""
"This node provides rich text style configuration options, including font "
"size, color, alignment, background color, etc., which can clearly display "
"the classification results and their confidence information."

