"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:113
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的类别。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple, the colors will be "
"assigned to different categories in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:117
msgid "决定如何为分类结果分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign colors to classification results:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:119
msgid "``CLASS``：根据分类类别着色，同一类别使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to classification category, use the same color "
"for the same category"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:120
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个预测结果分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: Assign a different color to each prediction result"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:121
msgid "``TRACK``：该节点不能使用此选项"
msgstr "``TRACK``: This option cannot be used for this node"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:125
msgid "设置文本标签的显示内容类型："
msgstr "Set the display content type of text labels:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:127
msgid "``Class``：仅显示类别名称"
msgstr "``Class``: Show only the class name"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:128
msgid "``Confidence``：仅显示置信度"
msgstr "``Confidence``: only shows confidence"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:129
msgid "``Class + Confidence``：显示类别名称和置信度"
msgstr "``Class + Confidence``: Display class name and confidence"

