msgstr "``GREEN``: green"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:139
msgid "``BLUE``：蓝色"
msgstr "``BLUE``: blue"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:140
msgid "或使用自定义HEX颜色值"
msgstr "Or use custom HEX color value"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:144
msgid "控制字体大小的比例因子。默认值为 ``1``，值越大字体越大。例如："
msgstr ""
"Scaling factor that controls font size.The default value is ``1``, the "
"larger the value, the larger the font.For example:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:146
msgid "``0.5``：较小字体"
msgstr "``0.5``: smaller font"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:147
msgid "``1``：标准字体（默认）"
msgstr "``1``: standard font (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:148
msgid "``2``：较大字体"
msgstr "``2``: Larger font"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:152
msgid "控制字体线条的粗细程度。默认值为 ``1``，值越大字体越粗。例如："
msgstr ""
"Controls the thickness of font lines.The default value is ``1``, the larger "
"the value, the bolder the font.For example:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:154
msgid "``1``：正常粗细（默认）"
msgstr "``1``: normal thickness (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:155
msgid "``2``：粗体"
msgstr "``2``: bold"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:156
msgid "``3``：更粗"
msgstr "``3``: thicker"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:160
msgid "设置文本周围的填充像素数，用于在文本和边框之间创建空间。默认值为 ``10`` 像素。较大的值会使标签背景更宽敞，提高可读性。"
msgstr ""
"Sets the number of padding pixels around the text, used to create space "
"between the text and the border.The default value is ``10`` pixels.Larger "
"values ​​make the label background wider, improving readability."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:164
msgid "设置标签边框的圆角半径："
msgstr "Set the corner radius of the label border:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:166
msgid "``0``：直角边框（默认）"
msgstr "``0``: right-angled border (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:167
msgid "``5``：轻微圆角"
msgstr "``5``: Slightly rounded corners"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:168
msgid "``10`` 及以上：明显圆角效果"
msgstr "``10`` and above: Obvious rounded corners effect"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/classification_display.rst:170
msgid "圆角值越大，边框越圆润。"
msgstr "The larger the fillet value, the rounder the border."
